# Coinzy Web

Read `AGENTS.md` for full rules and `INDEX.md` for the live file map. Update `INDEX.md` when you ship pages or change APIs.

## Musts

- Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, Tailwind 4 theme tokens — no new UI kits or default Inter stacks.
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity.
- Never import `lib/api/coinzy.ts` or `lib/api/marketplace-session.ts` in client code. Session JWTs go only through HTTP-only cookies via `app/api/auth/*` and other same-origin `/api/*` proxies.
- Catalogue API host ≠ marketplace API host (see `AGENTS.md`). Always https.
- Match Figma nodes from `PAGES-CHECKLIST.md`; don't invent layouts.
- Google auth: Firebase popup → `/api/auth/google` → `auth/social-login/google`. Figma `908`/`905` auth modals are not built on web (use `/auth?next=`).
- Reuse `SectionShell` / `SectionHeader` / shared grids; full-bleed art belongs in `SectionShell` `background`.
